# 'Micro-Sprint' Stability Upgrade & Hybrid Resume Plan

The current 5-minute (300s) chunks are too high-risk for the GTX 1050 Ti. If a 40-minute render fails at the end, we lose too much progress. This plan switches the remaining work to 1-minute (60s) sprints.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Timeline Safety**: We have already rendered 1 hour (60 minutes) using 5-minute blocks. Switching chunk sizes mid-project usually breaks the movie timeline. This plan uses a **Surgical Hybrid Adapter** to ensure the first hour (Legacy blocks) and the final 26 minutes (Micro-Sprints) join together perfectly.

